{"root":{"data":{"id":"digcwgilyvs0","created":1778554358103,"text":"写教案"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digd2dhcirs0","created":1778554821681,"text":"为什么写"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digd0ag3n600","created":1778554658347,"text":"教什么；怎么教；为什么这样做"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd0mz5mt40","created":1778554685621,"text":"分配时间，突出重点，突破难点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd0ysm13k0","created":1778554711346,"text":"上完课就写教案，教师反思、研究、改进"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd19ubfkw0","created":1778554735394,"text":"可以临时改课，换人"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"digd2i4lhu80","created":1778554831794,"text":"OBE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digd2nodfyw0","created":1778554843874,"text":"表述：课程主题与对应的学习成果"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd329ccx40","created":1778554875617,"text":"描述学生可以做到什么"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd646oggg0","created":1778555114902,"text":"举一个生活中的例子，讲一个道理；多个例子，细讲、粗讲；社会知识、情感知识"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digd8auu3gg0","created":1778555286151,"text":"学生为什么学不会；认识的障碍；挑战是什么：过程与能量转化难以联系起来"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digd9uslv6o0","created":1778555407916,"text":"如何解决：动画模拟；实验"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"digda4ps1nk0","created":1778555429513,"text":"教学活动，对应的学习成果是什么"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdcenuvp40","created":1778555607893,"text":"导入什么，探究什么，应用什么"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"digddvpyu0g0","created":1778555723390,"text":"教学环节"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digddzqakp40","created":1778555732117,"text":"以学生行为为主，成果达成导向（指向能力目标），每个活动都明确对应一个或多个学习成果；评价嵌入全过程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdf32i2k80","created":1778555817750,"text":"不必拘泥于复习-新授-练习-小结，基本开课闲聊，最近发生了什么；稍微宽松，"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdfqi46dk0","created":1778555868760,"text":"可根据成果需要设计项目式，问题式，翻转式等流程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdh6qen9c0","created":1778555982454,"text":"让学生知道自己老师是什么，做什么"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"digdidlb83c0","created":1778556075747,"text":"学生活动"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digdiiit4800","created":1778556086480,"text":"描述学生要干什么，要敲三角铁就去敲"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdippd2ao0","created":1778556102114,"text":"不要说学生理解，学生思考；说学生能说出，学生能画出，学生能写出"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"digdje2yo000","created":1778556155179,"text":"教师支持"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"digdjh00mds0","created":1778556161531,"text":"提供模版、问题链、资源包"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"digdjwn5xeo0","created":1778556195582,"text":"组织协作、巡视指导、适时点拨"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}